{
 "file": "06BLK00B base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:14",
   "ptr": "0x14",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "『クライツェンの民話』\\f",
   "en": "'Folk Tales of Kreutzen'",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:30",
   "ptr": "0x30",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "  本が戻ってる・・・\\n",
   "en": "The book has been returned...",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:49",
   "ptr": "0x49",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  読みますか？",
   "en": "Read it?",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  本が戻ってる・・・\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:64",
   "ptr": "0x64",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  昔々、この地がまだ、クライツェンと\\n",
   "en": "Long, long ago, before this land was called Kreutzen, something fell asleep deep in a cave.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:8d",
   "ptr": "0x8d",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  呼ばる前のこと。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:64"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:a4",
   "ptr": "0xa4",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  深い洞窟の底に、それは眠りについた\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  呼ばる前のこと。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:64"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:cd",
   "ptr": "0xcd",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "  よ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:64"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:d9",
   "ptr": "0xd9",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  人々はそいつが二度と再び目覚めない\\n",
   "en": "Day after day, the people prayed to the spirits of heaven and earth that it would never wake again.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:102",
   "ptr": "0x102",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ことを、来る日も来る日も、天地の精\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:d9"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:12b",
   "ptr": "0x12b",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  霊に祈り続けた。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:d9"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:143",
   "ptr": "0x143",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  そんな必死の祈りが実ったのかな？\\n",
   "en": "Maybe their desperate prayers paid off? For a while, peaceful days went by.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:16a",
   "ptr": "0x16a",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　しばらくは平和な日々が過ぎてったよ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:143"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:196",
   "ptr": "0x196",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  そんなある日、東方の異国から、\\n",
   "en": "Then one day, a prophet came from the lands of the East and said this:",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:1bb",
   "ptr": "0x1bb",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  ひとりの予言者がやって来て、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:196"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:1de",
   "ptr": "0x1de",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  こう言ったんだ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:196"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:1f6",
   "ptr": "0x1f6",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "  地の底の者を目覚めさせよ、\\n",
   "en": "Awaken the one beneath the earth. It is the bringer of great calamity, yet also the bringer of great evolution.",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:217",
   "ptr": "0x217",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  そは大いなる災厄をもたらす者、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:1f6"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:23c",
   "ptr": "0x23c",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  しかして、そは大いなる進化を\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:1f6"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:25f",
   "ptr": "0x25f",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  もたらす者なり。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:1f6"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:277",
   "ptr": "0x277",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  だけど、人々は誰もその言葉を信じず、\\n",
   "en": "But nobody believed his words, and the people stoned the prophet to death.",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:2a2",
   "ptr": "0x2a2",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  石つぶてを投じ予言者を殺してしまっ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:277"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:2cb",
   "ptr": "0x2cb",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "  たのさ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:277"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:2db",
   "ptr": "0x2db",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  それからさらに月日が流れ、みんなが\\n",
   "en": "More months and years went by, and when everyone had forgotten all about the prophecy...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:304",
   "ptr": "0x304",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  予言のことなど忘れてしまった頃・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:2db"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:330",
   "ptr": "0x330",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  勇猛な騎士の一団が、海を越えこの地\\n",
   "en": "a band of fierce knights came across the sea, and in the blink of an eye they ruled over everything.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:359",
   "ptr": "0x359",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  に現れ、瞬く間に全てを支配したんだ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:330"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:385",
   "ptr": "0x385",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  血を求め猛り狂う騎士たちは、人々を\\n",
   "en": "Raging for blood, the knights swung their swords to slaughter the people... and the people, with no way to fight back, fell one after another.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:3ae",
   "ptr": "0x3ae",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  皆殺しにしようと剣を振るい・・・\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:385"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:3d5",
   "ptr": "0x3d5",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  抗う術のない人々は、次々に倒れていっ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:385"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:400",
   "ptr": "0x400",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "  たよ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:385"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:40e",
   "ptr": "0x40e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  このまま、全てが死に絶えるかと思わ\\n",
   "en": "Just when it seemed that every last one of them would die...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:437",
   "ptr": "0x437",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  れた時・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:40e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:44b",
   "ptr": "0x44b",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "  人々は気づいたんだ。\\n",
   "en": "the people noticed. A strange power was beginning to stir inside them.",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:466",
   "ptr": "0x466",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  自分たちの中に、不思議な力が芽生え\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  人々は気づいたんだ。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:44b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:48f",
   "ptr": "0x48f",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  始めてることに。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:44b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:4a7",
   "ptr": "0x4a7",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  その力こそは、かつて災いの元として\\n",
   "en": "That power was the very evolution that the one they had loathed as the root of disaster had given them over the long ages.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:4d0",
   "ptr": "0x4d0",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  忌み嫌ったあの者が、永き年月をかけ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:4a7"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:4f9",
   "ptr": "0x4f9",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  て、人々にもたらした進化だった。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00B:4a7"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00B:527",
   "ptr": "0x527",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "禁書『クライツェン原住民族の研究』\\f",
   "en": "Forbidden book: 'A Study of the Kreutzen Natives'",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
